        "role": "cover",
        "subject": "A raked cutaway of two mirrored limestone exam rooms that share one glass wall. Each room is whole: a blue door, an exam table with a seated actor, a white-coated clinician on a mesh chair and a cart with a cyan screen. The two carts face each other across the glass.",
